"The earlier data could not be returned safely. Its files and keys have been kept. Reopen SORA to resume an interrupted return, or restore with your original backup." = "Data terdahulu tidak dapat dikembalikan dengan selamat. Fail dan kuncinya telah dikekalkan. Buka semula SORA untuk menyambung pengembalian yang terganggu, atau pulihkan dengan sandaran asal anda.";
"The earlier files were kept. Reopen SORA to continue, or try again." = "Fail terdahulu dikekalkan. Buka semula SORA untuk meneruskan atau cuba lagi.";
"The export can contain public wallet metadata, including addresses, account names, preferences, and transaction history." = "Eksport boleh mengandungi metadata dompet awam, termasuk alamat, nama akaun, keutamaan dan sejarah transaksi.";
"The installed wallet, settings, recovery marker, and Keychain were not changed." = "Dompet yang dipasang, tetapan, penanda pemulihan dan Rantai Kunci tidak diubah.";
"The phrase and derivation path could not be verified for this account, or the keys could not be saved. Existing accounts and keys were not replaced. Check your original backup and try again." = "Frasa dan laluan terbitan tidak dapat disahkan untuk akaun ini, atau kunci tidak dapat disimpan. Akaun dan kunci sedia ada tidak diganti. Semak sandaran asal anda dan cuba lagi.";
"The retained account could not be read for recovery. Its data has not been changed." = "Akaun yang dikekalkan tidak dapat dibaca untuk pemulihan. Datanya tidak diubah.";
"These wallets were saved by an older version without an ownership PIN. Restore them with their recovery phrase or Google Drive backup. The earlier files and keys remain on this iPhone." = "Dompet-dompet ini disimpan oleh versi lama tanpa PIN pemilikan. Pulihkan dengan frasa pemulihan atau sandaran Google Drive-nya. Fail dan kunci terdahulu kekal pada iPhone ini.";
"Try again to run the wallet checks once more." = "Cuba lagi untuk menjalankan semakan dompet sekali lagi.";
"Unlock this iPhone, then try again." = "Buka kunci iPhone ini, kemudian cuba lagi.";
"Unlock your existing backup" = "Buka kunci sandaran sedia ada anda";
